WEBVTT

00:00:00.334 --> 00:00:01.137
When was the last time

00:00:01.155 --> 00:00:02.080
you finished your coffee

00:00:02.098 --> 00:00:03.321
while it was still hot?

00:00:03.581 --> 00:00:04.972
That's where Mommy and Daddy

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:06.201
Break Club starts.

00:00:06.461 --> 00:00:08.566
A morning for parents in South
Florida.

00:00:08.838 --> 00:00:10.527
Come for coffee and brunch.

00:00:10.762 --> 00:00:12.941
Meet someone new while the DJ
plays.

00:00:13.201 --> 00:00:14.424
Take a quiet moment,

00:00:14.905 --> 00:00:17.083
or stay at the table for one more
story.

00:00:17.307 --> 00:00:18.968
We're planning two mornings a
month

00:00:18.986 --> 00:00:20.110
at different venues.

00:00:20.358 --> 00:00:22.500
Each event is ticketed separately.

00:00:22.772 --> 00:00:24.188
Join the free priority list

00:00:24.206 --> 00:00:25.993
for one or two adults.

00:00:26.265 --> 00:00:28.061
When a date opens, we'll email

00:00:28.079 --> 00:00:30.086
the venue, price and link.

00:00:30.346 --> 00:00:31.348
You pick your morning.
